WEBVTT

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
A KSeF invoice came in. The bot asks with one notification.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.500
One tap: deducted — and remembered for good.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.200
On your computer that invoice is already done. Phone and dashboard are one — you never click twice.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.700
Prefer the computer? The other questions wait in the dashboard — answer wherever suits you.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.700
Transfers confirmed in the dashboard — your phone won’t ask about them.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.700
The invoice from your phone is already on the list — next to the rest from KSeF, fetched automatically, month by month.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.700
Every month: VAT, lump-sum tax and ZUS calculated — amounts and deadlines on one page.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.200
Departures board: what has already “departed”, what is still on the apron.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.200
JPK ready. It goes to the tax office only after your tap.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Month closed. The tax office receipt arrives by e-mail.

